ack  panther  of course that title will be up for  challenge just like we saw in the first  black panther film which will add for an  interesting take in black panther 2.  shuri is technically next in line for  the throne but as kevin feige mentioned  they're going to explore other  characters from the first film  this means that umbaku is going to be  back and perhaps he feels like he might  make a better black panther than shuri  would although shuri has been black  panther in the comics before  there is also the chance that marvel  could just decide that shuri is going to  be the black panther and umbaku will  respect the fact that t'challa is gone  and let his sister be the new black  panther but there's also always the  possibility that killmonger could come  back somehow  it's the marvel cinematic universe  people who are dead don't  always stay dead there are many  different ways to bring characters back  to life in our universe  or they could even make it to where he  never died perhaps off-screen they give  him a heart-shaped herb and he lives  it's unsure right now but if they are  going to explore characters from the  first film he would be a very good  character to bring back  and it would also be really cool to  learn about the other tribes of wakanda  so embaku may be getting a lot more  screen time in black panther 2 than he  did in the first film  i think this is definitely a great  respectable move by marvel  honoring chadwick boseman not recasting  the character but  let me know what you think about  marvel's decision in the comments down  below  don't forget to subscribe to stay up to  date on all the latest mcu news and so  you can enter this week's giveaway for a  chance to win a tony stark  quantum suit funko pop for live updates  you can follow me on instagram and  twitter and as always thank you all so  much for watching  woof  bye
 

